__DESC__ = "记录有证据支持的安全风险或安全见解：根据目标、摘要和复现/观察方法生成可排查的描述；HTTP 场景有真实报文时可附原始请求、响应或现有文件。"
__VERBOSE_NAME__ = "Risk Output"
__VERBOSE_NAME_ZH__ = "风险输出"
__KEYWORDS__ = "security risk,security insight,security observation,vulnerability report,risk output,security audit,risk management,pentest finding,sqli,xss,rce,security finding,evidence,remediation"

__USAGE__ = <<<USAGE_BLOCK
记录安全风险或安全见解，每项独立发现一条。`target`、`title`、`summary` 必填；`summary` 写现象和影响，`reproduction` 写实际复现步骤、触发路径，或见解的观察与核对方法。工具把目标和这些内容写入 Risk 的 description，方便排查；不确定的步骤不要编造，避免只有标题或只有猜测。`title` 可写“中文标题 / English title”。`type` 缺省为 info；`severity` 不填时，info 见解为 info，其他类型为 low。`parameter`、`payload`、`evidence`、`solution` 按实际情况填写，避免重复报告同一问题。

数据包可选。HTTP/Web 发现若有真实报文，优先附同一次验证的完整 `request` 和 `response`；也可用 `request-file`、`response-file` 指向已有文件，由工具读取。文件优先于同名内联报文，空文件或不存在的文件会报错。只有部分报文时只填已有部分；不要编造报文、混配不同请求的响应，或为了记录 Risk 强迫 HTTP 工具保存文件。单份报文超过 2 MiB 会被截断并提示。非 HTTP 见解可只提交可核对的观察证据。

典型案例：无数据包的安全见解，给出观察入口和核对方法：
[[- if .FunctionCallMode -]]
arguments 示例：
```json
{
  "target": "example.com:443",
  "title": "公开服务暴露调试入口",
  "summary": "发现调试入口可被外部访问，需要确认访问控制与可见信息范围。",
  "reproduction": "访问 /debug/，记录返回状态和可见页面；在未登录会话中复核。",
  "type": "info",
  "severity": "info",
  "evidence": "未登录请求返回调试页面标题；未进一步访问敏感数据。"
}
```
[[- else -]]
文本流 action：
```json
{
  "@action": "directly_call_tool",
  "directly_call_tool_name": "cybersecurity-risk",
  "directly_call_tool_params": {
    "target": "example.com:443",
    "title": "公开服务暴露调试入口",
    "summary": "发现调试入口可被外部访问，需要确认访问控制与可见信息范围。",
    "reproduction": "访问 /debug/，记录返回状态和可见页面；在未登录会话中复核。",
    "type": "info",
    "severity": "info",
    "evidence": "未登录请求返回调试页面标题；未进一步访问敏感数据。"
  }
}
```
[[- end -]]

[[- if .FunctionCallMode -]]
HTTP 风险：所有参数直接写入 JSON；报文换行用 `\r\n` 转义：
arguments 示例：
```json
{
  "target": "https://example.com/orders/1002",
  "title": "订单越权访问",
  "summary": "普通用户可读取其他用户的订单摘要。",
  "reproduction": "以普通用户登录，先读取自己的订单，再将 GET /orders/1001 中的订单 ID 改为 1002；响应返回另一用户的订单。",
  "type": "unauth-access",
  "severity": "high",
  "parameter": "orderId",
  "request": "GET /orders/1002 HTTP/1.1\r\nHost: example.com\r\nCookie: session=example\r\n\r\n",
  "response": "HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\nContent-Type: application/json\r\n\r\n{\"id\":1002,\"owner\":\"other-user\"}"
}
```
[[- else -]]
HTTP 风险：普通参数写 JSON，多行报文用本次 nonce 的 AITAG：
文本流 action：
```json
{
  "@action": "directly_call_tool",
  "directly_call_tool_name": "cybersecurity-risk",
  "directly_call_tool_params": {
    "target": "https://example.com/orders/1002",
    "title": "订单越权访问",
    "summary": "普通用户可读取其他用户的订单摘要。",
    "reproduction": "以普通用户登录，先读取自己的订单，再将 GET /orders/1001 中的订单 ID 改为 1002；响应返回另一用户的订单。",
    "type": "unauth-access",
    "severity": "high",
    "parameter": "orderId"
  }
}
```
<|TOOL_PARAM_request_{NONCE}|>
GET /orders/1002 HTTP/1.1
Host: example.com
Cookie: session=example

<|TOOL_PARAM_request_END_{NONCE}|>
<|TOOL_PARAM_response_{NONCE}|>
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":1002,"owner":"other-user"}
<|TOOL_PARAM_response_END_{NONCE}|>
[[- end -]]

已有完整报文文件时，把实际路径填入 `request-file`、`response-file`；不要求为了填这两个参数而新建文件。`info` 见解按目标、输入点和标题区分，补充同一见解的证据时保持这些字段一致。提交后核对工具结果中的保存状态。
USAGE_BLOCK

yakit.AutoInitYakit()

# normalizeTarget strips scheme, default ports (80/443), and trailing
# slash from a URL so that the same logical target always produces the
# same risk hash. For non-URL inputs (IP, host:port) the value is returned
# as-is after trimming whitespace.
normalizeTarget = func(raw) {
    s = str.TrimSpace(raw)
    if s == "" {
        return s
    }
    # strip scheme
    if str.HasPrefix(s, "https://") {
        s = s[len("https://"):]
    } elif str.HasPrefix(s, "http://") {
        s = s[len("http://"):]
    }
    # strip default ports
    s = str.Replace(s, ":443/", "/", 1)
    s = str.Replace(s, ":80/", "/", 1)
    # strip trailing slash (keep root)
    if len(s) > 1 {
        s = str.TrimSuffix(s, "/")
    }
    return s
}

# normalizeType lowercases and trims the risk type so that "SQLI" and
# "sqli" produce the same hash.
normalizeType = func(raw) {
    return str.ToLower(str.TrimSpace(raw))
}

# normalizeParameter trims the parameter name so that " username " and
# "username" produce the same hash.
normalizeParameter = func(raw) {
    return str.TrimSpace(raw)
}

normalizeTitle = func(rawTitle) {
    normalized = str.TrimSpace(rawTitle)
    title = normalized
    titleVerbose = normalized

    if str.Contains(normalized, " / ") {
        parts = str.SplitN(normalized, " / ", 2)
        if len(parts) == 2 {
            zh = str.TrimSpace(parts[0])
            en = str.TrimSpace(parts[1])
            if zh != "" && en != "" {
                title = en
                titleVerbose = zh
            }
        }
    }

    return title, titleVerbose
}

truncateForDescription = func(raw, limit) {
    if raw == "" {
        return ""
    }
    if len(raw) <= limit {
        return raw
    }
    return raw[:limit] + "\n... (truncated, full evidence stored in details)"
}

buildDescription = func(summary, target, reproduction, parameter, payload, evidence) {
    parts = []string{}
    if summary != "" {
        parts.Push(summary)
    }
    if target != "" {
        parts.Push(sprintf("触发入口/观察对象：%s", target))
    }
    if reproduction != "" {
        parts.Push(sprintf("复现/观察方法：\n%s", reproduction))
    }
    if parameter != "" {
        parts.Push(sprintf("受影响输入：%s", parameter))
    }
    if payload != "" {
        parts.Push(sprintf("验证输入：%s", payload))
    }

    evidenceExcerpt = truncateForDescription(str.TrimSpace(evidence), 2000)
    if evidenceExcerpt != "" {
        parts.Push(sprintf("证据：\n%s", evidenceExcerpt))
    }
    return str.Join(parts, "\n\n")
}

defaultSolutionByType = func(riskType, parameter, target) {
    focus = "受影响入口"
    if parameter != "" {
        focus = sprintf("参数/入口 %s", parameter)
    } elif target != "" {
        focus = sprintf("目标 %s", target)
    }

    switch str.ToLower(str.TrimSpace(riskType)) {
    case "sqli":
        return sprintf("对 %s 改用参数化查询或预编译语句，禁止将外部输入直接拼接进 SQL；同时补齐输入校验与异常审计。", focus)
    case "xss":
        return sprintf("对 %s 的可控输出执行上下文相关编码，并结合 CSP、模板自动转义等机制阻断脚本执行。", focus)
    case "rce", "rce-command", "rce-code", "ssti":
        return sprintf("移除或隔离 %s 对命令执行/模板执行能力的直接暴露，建立白名单约束并避免将用户输入拼接进入执行上下文。", focus)
    case "xxe":
        return sprintf("在解析 XML 的位置禁用外部实体与 DTD，限制协议访问范围，并对 %s 的输入来源做严格校验。", focus)
    case "unserialize", "deserialization":
        return sprintf("避免对不可信数据执行反序列化；如无法避免，应使用安全序列化方案、类型白名单与完整性校验保护 %s。", focus)
    case "lfi", "file-read", "file-download", "path-traversal":
        return sprintf("对 %s 涉及的路径输入做规范化与白名单约束，限制访问根目录并禁止跳目录访问敏感文件。", focus)
    case "file-write", "file-upload", "rfi":
        return sprintf("限制 %s 的文件写入/上传能力，校验文件类型与目标路径，将文件落盘到隔离目录并关闭危险解析行为。", focus)
    case "unauth-access", "auth-bypass", "privilege-escalation":
        return sprintf("在 %s 补齐身份认证、授权校验与服务端访问控制，避免仅依赖前端状态、来源头或可伪造标识决定权限。", focus)
    case "ssrf":
        return sprintf("对 %s 的外部请求能力建立协议/域名/IP 白名单，拦截内网与云元数据地址访问，并记录异常出站行为。", focus)
    case "csrf":
        return sprintf("为 %s 相关操作增加 CSRF Token、SameSite Cookie 与关键操作二次确认，并校验请求来源。", focus)
    case "weak-pass", "weak-password", "weak-credential", "insecure-default":
        return sprintf("立即替换 %s 使用的弱口令或默认配置，启用强凭据策略、最小权限与登录审计。", focus)
    case "info-exposure", "cve-baseline", "compliance-test":
        return sprintf("收敛 %s 暴露的敏感信息与不安全配置，按基线要求修复已识别问题，并复测确认不再泄露。", focus)
    case "logic":
        return sprintf("补齐 %s 对业务状态、对象归属与关键流程前后置条件的服务端校验，避免通过流程错位或参数组合绕过限制。", focus)
    default:
        return sprintf("结合当前风险摘要与证据，复核 %s 的输入校验、输出处理、访问控制和安全配置，并在修复后重新验证问题不再可复现。", focus)
    }
}

target := cli.String("target", cli.setHelp("affected target: URL, host, IP, or host:port"), cli.setRequired(true))
titleInput := cli.String("title", cli.setHelp("one-line risk title; use `中文标题 / English title` if bilingual context is useful"), cli.setRequired(true))
summary := cli.Text("summary", cli.setHelp("required summary: what is vulnerable, where it is triggered, and why it matters"), cli.setRequired(true))
reproduction := cli.Text("reproduction", cli.setHelp("actual reproduction steps or trigger path; for an insight, state how it was observed and checked; do not invent steps"))
riskType := cli.String("type", cli.setHelp("risk type such as sqli/xss/rce/ssrf/auth-bypass/unauth-access/path-traversal/info-exposure/weak-pass"), cli.setRequired(false))
severity := cli.String("severity", cli.setHelp("severity: critical/high/middle/low/info; defaults to info for insights, low for other risks"))
parameter := cli.String("parameter", cli.setHelp("triggering parameter, header, or input point"))
payload := cli.Text("payload", cli.setHelp("payload or verification input"))
evidence := cli.Text("evidence", cli.setHelp("concise proof, verification notes, or traffic excerpts"))
solution := cli.Text("solution", cli.setHelp("optional explicit remediation guidance"))
requestRaw := cli.HTTPPacket("request", cli.setHelp("complete actual HTTP request packet; use request-file for an existing complete packet file"))
responseRaw := cli.HTTPPacket("response", cli.setHelp("complete actual HTTP response packet; use response-file for an existing complete packet file"))
requestFile := cli.String("request-file", cli.setHelp("existing path to a complete HTTP request packet; read and store its content; takes priority over request"))
responseFile := cli.String("response-file", cli.setHelp("existing path to a complete HTTP response packet; read and store its content; takes priority over response"))
cli.check()

if str.TrimSpace(summary) == "" {
    die("summary is required and must not be empty")
}

// Normalize before creating risk options so the stored fields and dedup hash
// use the same canonical type and parameter.
riskType = normalizeType(riskType)
if riskType == "" {
    riskType = "info"
}
if str.TrimSpace(severity) == "" {
    if riskType == "info" {
        severity = "info"
    } else {
        severity = "low"
    }
}
parameter = normalizeParameter(parameter)
reproduction = str.TrimSpace(reproduction)

title, titleVerbose = normalizeTitle(titleInput)
description = buildDescription(summary, target, reproduction, parameter, payload, evidence)

finalSolution = str.TrimSpace(solution)
if finalSolution == "" && riskType != "info" {
    finalSolution = defaultSolutionByType(riskType, parameter, target)
}

details = {
    "title_input": titleInput,
    "summary": summary,
}
if reproduction != "" {
    details["reproduction"] = reproduction
}
if parameter != "" {
    details["parameter"] = parameter
}
if payload != "" {
    details["payload"] = payload
}
if evidence != "" {
    details["evidence"] = evidence
}
if finalSolution != "" {
    details["solution"] = finalSolution
}
// A supplied file takes precedence over inline text so the chosen source is unambiguous.
requestSource = ""
if requestFile != "" {
    req, err := file.ReadFile(requestFile)
    if err != nil {
        die(sprintf("failed to read request-file %s: %v", requestFile, err))
    }
    if len(req) == 0 {
        die(sprintf("request-file is empty: %s", requestFile))
    }
    requestRaw = string(req)
    requestSource = "file"
} elif requestRaw != "" {
    requestSource = "inline"
}

responseSource = ""
if responseFile != "" {
    rsp, err := file.ReadFile(responseFile)
    if err != nil {
        die(sprintf("failed to read response-file %s: %v", responseFile, err))
    }
    if len(rsp) == 0 {
        die(sprintf("response-file is empty: %s", responseFile))
    }
    responseRaw = string(rsp)
    responseSource = "file"
} elif responseRaw != "" {
    responseSource = "inline"
}

if requestSource != "" {
    details["request_source"] = requestSource
}
if responseSource != "" {
    details["response_source"] = responseSource
}
// risk.request/risk.response currently retain at most 2 MiB per packet.
if len(requestRaw) > 2097152 {
    details["request_original_bytes"] = len(requestRaw)
    details["request_truncated"] = true
    yakit.Warn("request packet exceeds the 2 MiB risk field limit; source has %d bytes and will be truncated", len(requestRaw))
}
if len(responseRaw) > 2097152 {
    details["response_original_bytes"] = len(responseRaw)
    details["response_truncated"] = true
    yakit.Warn("response packet exceeds the 2 MiB risk field limit; source has %d bytes and will be truncated", len(responseRaw))
}

opts = []
opts.Push(risk.title(title))
opts.Push(risk.titleVerbose(titleVerbose))
opts.Push(risk.type(riskType))
opts.Push(risk.severity(severity))
opts.Push(risk.description(description))
opts.Push(risk.solution(finalSolution))
opts.Push(risk.details(details))

if parameter != "" {
    opts.Push(risk.parameter(parameter))
}
if payload != "" {
    opts.Push(risk.payload(payload))
}

if requestRaw != "" {
    opts.Push(risk.request(requestRaw))
}

if responseRaw != "" {
    opts.Push(risk.response(responseRaw))
}

// Preserve the existing target normalization for vulnerability records.
target = normalizeTarget(target)

// @ssa-ignore
record = risk.CreateRisk(target, opts...)
if riskType == "info" {
    // Independent observations often have no parameter. Retain their target
    // path and title in the identity, while evidence updates reuse the record.
    record.Hash = codec.Sha256(json.dumps(["cybersecurity-risk:info", target, parameter, title]))[:32]
}
// Save returns local database and runtime sink errors to the tool caller.
saveErr = risk.Save(record)
if saveErr != nil {
    die(saveErr)
}
RESULT = {"operation": "save_risk", "operation_status": "completed", "risk_hash": record.Hash}
